## Exemple de integrare

Valorile sunt demonstrative. Înlocuiește ID-urile și folosește doar propriile permisiuni.

### cURL

```sh
curl --fail-with-body -X POST https://openaliment.ro/api/v1/manage/trade-items/aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa/labels \
  -H 'Accept: application/json' \
  -H 'Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN' \
  -H 'Idempotency-Key: exemplu-v1PostManageTradeItemsIdLabels-001' \
  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  --data '{"version_key":"E1","name":"Iaurt natural","category":"lactate","ingredients":"Lapte, culturi lactice.","allergens":"Lapte.","net_quantity":"200 g","operator":"Denumirea și adresa operatorului"}'
```

### JavaScript

```javascript
const response = await fetch("https://openaliment.ro/api/v1/manage/trade-items/aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa/labels", {
  method: "POST",
  credentials: "omit",
  headers: {
  "Accept": "application/json",
  "Authorization": "Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN",
  "Idempotency-Key": "exemplu-v1PostManageTradeItemsIdLabels-001",
  "Content-Type": "application/json"
},
  body: JSON.stringify({
  "version_key": "E1",
  "name": "Iaurt natural",
  "category": "lactate",
