`application/json`

Exemplu sintetic:

```json
{
  "name": "Iaurt natural",
  "visibility": "private",
  "technical_status": "experimental",
  "recipe_identity": "pbt:R1",
  "nominal_input_mass_g": 3790,
  "originals": 18,
  "recovered": 7,
  "quarantine": "PBT-SRC-06",
